tion":"","FileSizeInBytes":12525450,"ForegroundColor":"#FFFFFF","Height":2160,"ImagePositionInfo":"Xbox/5","ImagePurpose":"Screenshot","UnscaledImageSHA256Hash":"GEmQZfmTPAwGL8rueDtdbF0sBFp65341h1BM/ZqlPd0=","Uri":"//store-images.s-microsoft.com/image/apps.18712.13664541971149542.2f5fbe40-bf98-4cd6-8d48-94e08f070c43.27e3ff0e-4219-4459-a2bb-6b8696b20b4a","Width":3840}],"Videos":[],"ProductDescription":"GROUNDBREAKING MELEE COMBAT\nMake your blade an extension of yourself with For Honor’s unique 3-directional combat system: the Art of Battle. Attack, parry, and block from 3 directions in immersive melee combat. Choose from a wide variety of weapons and fighting styles inspired by legendary warriors.\n\nTEAM-BASED ONLINE PvP\nFace other players in team-based brutal 4v4 Dominion. Hold objectives to push back the enemy team, or enjoy a more personal experience in 2v2 and 1v1. Once you're ready, go and prove your worth in our Ranked game modes.\n\nBECOME A LEGENDARY WARRIOR\nChoose from a wide roster of unique heroes, each with their own weapons and fighting styles. Pick a Knight, Samurai, Viking, Wu Lin, or Outlander and customize your hero with a wide variety of armor, weapons, colors, and materials to stand out on the battlefield.\n\n10 YEARS OF EVER-EVOLVING CONTENT\nFor Honor is 10 years old! 10 years of new content are waiting for you, and you can expect new heroes, game mode events, and maps to regularly refresh your experience. There's always something new to enjoy in For Honor!","ProductTitle":"For Honor Standard","ShortTitle":"For Honor Standard","SortTitle":"For Honor Standard","FriendlyTitle":null,"ShortDescription":"For Honor is a groundbreaking team-based PvP melee fighting game where Knights, Samurai, Vikings, Wu Lin, and more clash in endless battles. Pick unique heroes and master intense 4v4, 2v2, or 1v1 battles.","SearchTitles":[],"VoiceTitle":"","RenderGroupDetails":null,"ProductDisplayRanks":[],"InteractiveModelConfig":null,"Interactive3DEnabled":false